OL,3,ASeveral dead or injured in major fire
OL,4,Aat Canada military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been killed or
OL,7,Finjured as a result of a large fire
OL,8,Fnear a Canadian military base in
OL,9,FAlberta, the nation's military has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe Canadian Armed Forces (CAF) said
OL,13,Fthe full extent of the incident's
OL,14,Fimpact was being assessed and that
OL,15,Fdetails of casualties and injuries
OL,16,Fwould not be made public until that was
OL,17,Fcomplete.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
