OL,3,ASeveral dead or injured in major fire
OL,4,Aat Canada military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,7,Fthe fire broke out around 16:00 local
OL,8,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday, is one of
OL,9,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,10,Fbases.
OL,12,FCanadian TV network Global News
OL,13,Freported that at least seven were
OL,14,Fkilled and dozens more injured when a
OL,15,Fgas line or gas well was hit during a
OL,16,Flive-fire training exercise, citing
OL,17,Funnamed military sources.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
